# The image compiles in its builder stage, so its context is source and the
# two files that pin the toolchain. Everything else -- `.venv` above all --
# stays out of the context and out of every layer.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/
# The corpus. data/sample-*.jsonl is committed; data/notes.jsonl and
# data/themes.jsonl are gitignored and ride in from the WORKING DIRECTORY,
# which is what a build context is. An image built with them present holds
# unpublished material: keep it in a private registry.
!data/
